  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Six substantial physical game-show obstacles: tilting steps, rotating
    logs, swinging wrecking balls, a weight-driven seesaw bridge, spinning discs
    and the giant curved warped wall. Drive and brake with your assigned source.
    ACTION jumps. Hold COMPRESSION to lower the actual NWH suspension; release it
    while jumping for a stronger super-jump. Steering also gives modest leaning,
    two-wheel balance and bounded air correction. Gravity and forward momentum remain
    real. Each obstacle has a safe checkpoint after its whole-truck exit. A genuine
    fall costs exactly5seconds and recovers at the last checkpoint, not the beginning.
    The2\u20133minute attempt timer always continues, except during pause. Complete
    the curved wall and physically hit the giant bell with your front bumper. Fastest
    adjusted actual time wins; equal times compare falls then share placing. Failed
    runs rank by obstacles cleared.1\u20138alternating participants, up to4humans,
    AI, full-screen active-driver chase/cab/elevated views, free look, horn, crew
    identities, selected weather, recorded highlights and rematch. AI uses these
    same movement abilities and checkpoints; no invented scores."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
